  [See if they can do it again.],
  [id="5----for-the-fifth-bug-of-christmas-my-manager-said-to-me"\>5. For the fifth bug of Christmas, my manager said to me:],
  [Ask for a dump],
  [Run with the debugger],
  [Try to reproduce it],
  [Ask them how they did it and],
